# --- Rust ---
/target

# Cargo.lock is COMMITTED, deliberately: tests 10 and 11
# (bindgen_output_stable, vendored_build_reproducible) depend on
# dependency versions being pinned across machines and CI.
# Do not add Cargo.lock here.

# --- Vendored sources ---
# vendor/ is tracked (vendored mlx-c + MLX core, per PINS.md).
# build.rs runs all CMake builds inside OUT_DIR under target/,
# so no vendor-local build directories ever need ignoring.
# Never configure CMake manually inside vendor/.

